1
00:00:00,407 --> 00:00:01,407
(Sheldon:)Leonard, this is my Meemaw.

2
00:00:01,408 --> 00:00:02,678
(Leonard:)Hi. So nice
to finally meet you.

3
00:00:02,676 --> 00:00:04,246
(Leonard:)Let me take this
for you, Meemaw.

4
00:00:04,244 --> 00:00:05,414
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

5
00:00:05,412 --> 00:00:07,412
(Sheldon:)No. Oh, no.
Now you call her “Constance.”

6
00:00:07,414 --> 00:00:08,884
I call her “Meemaw.”

7
00:00:08,882 --> 00:00:10,152
(Sheldon:)You have your own Meemaw.

8
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:12,120
(Sheldon:)It's not my fault
she died when you were four.

9
00:00:13,220 --> 00:00:16,190
(Meemaw:)Is that nice to say
to your friend?

10
00:00:16,189 --> 00:00:18,089
(Sheldon:)It isn't, Meemaw.

11
00:00:18,091 --> 00:00:20,261
(Sheldon:)Sorry, Leonard.

12
00:00:21,495 --> 00:00:23,925
(Leonard:)Can you please
live with us forever?

13
00:00:23,930 --> 00:00:26,300
Oh. (laughs)

14
00:00:27,467 --> 00:00:29,067
That's ridiculous!
If you had

15
00:00:29,069 --> 00:00:31,539
(Howard:)a superpower,
and spent your whole life

16
00:00:31,538 --> 00:00:33,238
(Howard:)being told to suppress it,

17
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:35,670
(Howard:)when you finally decide
to embrace that power,

18
00:00:35,676 --> 00:00:37,906
why hide in isolation?!

19
00:00:37,911 --> 00:00:39,341
(Raj:)I'm sorry,

20
00:00:39,346 --> 00:00:42,986
(Raj:)and how much money did
your version of Frozen make?!

21
00:00:44,117 --> 00:00:45,687
(Howard:)I'm just saying,

22
00:00:45,686 --> 00:00:47,356
instead of “Let it Go,”
she should really sing,

23
00:00:47,354 --> 00:00:49,654
“Look At Me Hiding in a Freezer
Like a Dove Bar.”

24
00:00:50,590 --> 00:00:53,220
(Raj:)She built an ice castle,
made a snow monster

25
00:00:53,226 --> 00:00:56,226
(Raj:)and gave herself
a complete makeover in one day.

26
00:00:56,229 --> 00:00:57,929
(Raj:)You know what I saw
you do today?

27
00:00:57,931 --> 00:01:00,401
(Raj:)Eat a block of cream cheese
straight from the foil

